   │
 8 │ def f: [a: Type] -> [auto order: Ord a] -> a -> a := [a: Type] [b: Type] (x: a) => x
   │                                                      ───────────────┬───────────────  
   │                                                                     ╰───────────────── this lambda takes an implicit parameter first, but the expected type `[auto order: Ord a] → a → a` takes an `auto` one
